"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5267900","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4701970","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:09Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4701970,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4701970","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:09Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4701970,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4701970","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:09Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4701970,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4701970-1847286114040099","game_id":"steam-4701970","kind":"announcement","title":"Come hang out with Víctor & Álex today at 18:30 UTC!","summary":"https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/46141441/2b3d557223ea1777b15cc47f9b1fe8137b4a72cb.png Hey everyone! 😄 Álex and I are going live here on Steam today, Saturday, October 24, at 18:30 UTC — 20:30 CEST / 2:30 PM EDT / 11:30 AM PDT. We'll be playing Geometry Rift: Apocalypse and chatting with whoever drops by. Curious about the game, or how a father and son ended up making it together? Come ask us! The demo is free and you can play it right now. It'll stay available after Steam Next Fest to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T16:53:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040099","verified_at":"2026-10-24T17:19:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701970-1846651706675990","game_id":"steam-4701970","kind":"announcement","title":"We’re getting everything ready for October’s Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hi everyone! We’re getting everything ready for Steam Next Fest, October 19–26, and we’d love you to come spend some time with us :) If you haven’t met us yet, we’re a father and son making a game together. It’s called Geometry Rift: Apocalypse, and after all the hours we’ve put into it, we’re really looking forward to seeing you play it and hearing what you think. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cCzRhImylXs We’ll be playing live! During the week, we’ll play the demo, show you some exclusive foo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T00:53:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675990","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701970-1844115010505168","game_id":"steam-4701970","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is live!","summary":"Geometry Rift: Apocalypse Now Has an OFFICIAL DEMO!After more than 10 months of development, and following feedback from a few beta testers, the official Geometry Rift demo was released today on Steam!It’s been an amazing journey. We still have some work ahead of us—finishing up the levels and bosses and tweaking the game’s balance—but the core mechanics, optimization, and, well, the game engine itself are all ready. We tested the game on our Steam Deck, and it looks and plays great! Keep in min","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T18:45:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505168","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701970-1838407329264061","game_id":"steam-4701970","kind":"announcement","title":"When two weapons become one","summary":"My son and I had this stuck in our heads for a long time: that sacred survivor-like moment where you max out a weapon and it suddenly turns into something else.They're in the game now: 10 evolutions, each a fusion of two weapons. The rule we set ourselves is that every weapon is used exactly once, so no evolution is \"free\" — to unlock one you have to max out both its parents. When that golden card finally shows up in the level-up, you know you earned it.The balance nearly gave me a heart attack.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-19T18:06:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329264061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701970-1836506165584493","game_id":"steam-4701970","kind":"announcement","title":"From a Green Phosphor Prototype to a 4K Neon Universe","summary":"Hi everyone!I'm Awezoom. With almost 50 years under my belt, I've spent a lifetime tinkering with computers, programming, designing, and composing music since the days when games were nothing more than pixels, and the demoscene and trackers were among us.Throughout my life, one thing hasn't changed. Video games have always been my great passion—and they still are—and today I want to talk to you about one of the most special projects I've ever worked on: Geometry Rift, a game I am developing side","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T20:16:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165584493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701970-1836506165546978","game_id":"steam-4701970","kind":"announcement","title":"Quest for perfect Glow: A short story behind Geometry Rift look","summary":"Chasing The Glow I’ve been obsessed with one thing since the beginning of Geometry Rift: I wanted the screen to fill with colored light.Not just a glow around each enemy. I wanted groups of enemies to create areas of color. If ten orange enemies are together, that area should feel orange. If a group of blue enemies is nearby, both colors should mix naturally. Bright near the vector lines, softer as it spreads out.It sounds simple, but getting there has been one of those small technical battles t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T19:37:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165546978","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4701970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4701970":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4701970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z"},"5267900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":